Compounds used as refrigerants may be described using either the appropriate prefix above or with the prefixes "R-" or "refrigerant". Thus, CFC-12 may also be written as R-12 or Refrigerant 12.<br />An alkene, olefin, or olefine is an [[unsaturated compound]] containing at least one [[carbon-carbon double bond]].<ref name=Wade/>

